## The lab: the page itself
lab_title = The lab
lab_intro = Pick a size and a seed and edit any parameter; the floor is generated again in your browser.
lab_loading = Loading the generator…
lab_needs_js = The lab runs the generator in your browser, with WebAssembly, so it needs JavaScript.
lab_sizes_title = Choose a size
lab_sizes_help = Each size is a starting grid with the large blocks and leaf chambers that go with it. You can edit any value afterwards.
lab_size_button = { $n ->
    [1] Small
    [2] Medium
    [3] Large
   *[4] Huge
  }
lab_size_aria = { $n ->
    [1] Start from the small size
    [2] Start from the medium size
    [3] Start from the large size
   *[4] Start from the huge size
  }
lab_size_1 = Small: a compact grid with a few rooms.
lab_size_2 = Medium: a floor of a few dozen rooms.
lab_size_3 = Large: a big grid with many rooms and leaf chambers.
lab_size_4 = Huge: the largest grid, with the most rooms.
lab_seed = Seed
lab_seed_help = The same seed and parameters generate the same floor. Change the seed to explore another one.
lab_seed_prev = Previous seed
lab_seed_next = Next seed
lab_seed_random = Random
lab_seed_random_aria = New random seed
lab_seed_error = The seed must be an integer between 0 and 4,294,967,295.
lab_copy = Copy parameters (JSON)
lab_copy_link = Copy link
lab_link_copied = Link copied: it opens the lab on this size, seed and parameters.
lab_paste = Paste parameters…
lab_paste_title = Paste parameters
lab_paste_text = Paste a Λ as JSON: what Copy parameters writes, or what the desktop app saves. The size and the seed come with it when it has them.
lab_paste_apply = Use these parameters
lab_paste_cancel = Cancel
lab_paste_bad = Could not read the parameters: { $error }
lab_pasted = Parameters pasted. Undo goes back.
lab_copied = Parameters copied as JSON.
lab_no_clipboard = The clipboard is not available in this browser.
lab_reset_size = Reset to size default
lab_changed_none = Default configuration
lab_changed_some = { $n } parameters changed
lab_changed_one = 1 parameter changed
lab_changed_group = { $n } of { $total } changed
lab_howto_title = How to explore this floor
lab_howto_text = Drag the plan to move it, use the wheel or the zoom buttons, click a room to pick it. With the keyboard, Tab into the plan: the arrows move it, plus and minus zoom, 0 fits it, the square brackets pick the previous or next room and Esc lets go. Alt+1 to 4 pick a size, Alt+R a random seed, Alt+Left and Right the previous or next seed, Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Y undo and redo, a slash goes to the filter and a question mark lists the keys.
lab_overlays_title = Overlays
lab_overlays_help = Overlays show how the generator built the floor. Turn them on one at a time to compare without hiding the rooms.
lab_overlay_cells = Grid
lab_overlay_cells_help = Shows the borders of the cells that make up the floor grid.
lab_overlay_labels = Room names
lab_overlay_labels_help = Shows the number of each room, and the entrance and the exit.
lab_overlay_ports = Possible doors
lab_overlay_ports_help = Shows every possible door position, including the ones that were not used.
lab_overlay_pairs = Pairs considered
lab_overlay_pairs_help = Shows the pairs of rooms that entered the connection search.
lab_overlay_candidates = Candidate paths
lab_overlay_candidates_help = Shows the candidate paths available to the generator.
lab_experiments_title = Examples
lab_experiments_intro = Apply a sample change to see its effect. It only replaces the parameters involved, and Undo takes it back.
lab_exp_shapes = Mix shapes
lab_exp_shapes_detail = Sets equal weights for the shapes and enables the octilinear alphabet.
lab_exp_shapes_done = Experiment applied: varied shapes and diagonal directions.
lab_exp_cycles = Create more routes
lab_exp_cycles_detail = Raises the target density to favor cycles and shortcuts.
lab_exp_cycles_done = Experiment applied: high cycle density.
lab_exp_junctions = Show T/X junctions
lab_exp_junctions_detail = Raises the weights of three- and four-arm junctions.
lab_exp_junctions_done = Experiment applied: T and X junctions favored.
lab_exp_rooms = Use circular rooms
lab_exp_rooms_detail = Makes circular rooms dominate the draw.
lab_exp_rooms_done = Experiment applied: preference for circular rooms.
lab_params_title = Parameters
lab_params_help = Changes are applied to the floor automatically. Each field has an explanation and its limits.
lab_group_reset = Reset this group
lab_junction_title = Junction conductance
lab_junction_badge = info
lab_junction_text = The conductance of a junction is a parameter of the reference model that the generator does not use yet, so it is shown but cannot be edited.
lab_junction_current = Current value
lab_junction_inf = ∞ (arms joined)
lab_perf_title = Developer
lab_perf_intro = Times the generator on floors that are not shown, with the size's defaults, not the values changed in the form.
lab_perf_idle = Benchmarks use the default parameters of the selected size.
lab_perf_40 = Time 40 floors
lab_perf_800 = Compare 800 floors, one worker and all
lab_perf_40_result = Average: { $ms } ms per floor · { $invalid } invalid of 40.
lab_perf_800_run = Measuring the batch…
lab_perf_800_result = 800 floors: 1 worker { $one } ms · { $workers } workers { $many } ms · { $invalid } invalid.
lab_perf_800_fail = Could not measure the batch: { $error }
lab_map_view = Plan
lab_map_label = Floor plan: { $rooms } rooms, { $state }. Tab into it: the arrows move it, plus and minus zoom, the square brackets pick a room.
lab_map_instructions = Drag to move · wheel to zoom · click a room to pick it
lab_zoom_out = Zoom out
lab_zoom_in = Zoom in
lab_fit = Fit
lab_controls_aria = Generator controls
lab_toolbar_aria = Plan controls
lab_results_aria = Floor validation and measures

